  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "當代室內設計思潮",
    "sub_ename": "THE TRENDS OF CONTEMPORARY INTERIOR DESIGN",
    "describe_ch": "本課程的重點主要在探討二十世紀中葉至今的室內設計思潮發展，焦點集中在主要的室內設計潮流、理論、設計師和他們在世界知名的空間設計作品、櫥櫃、家具與織品等設施。另外，也特別探討室內設計受舊建築再利用、時尚流行、環保永續與科技發展之影響。因此本課程不僅僅探討室內設計之歷史、風格與文化背景的差異，更希望能瞭解這些設計作品背後的時代精神。",
    "describe_eh": "The main issue of this course is to explore the development of interior design thoughts from the mid-twentieth to the present. This focus is on the main interior design trends, theories, designers and their world famous spatial design works, cabinets, furniture and fabrics. In addition, it also specifically discusses the influence of the reuse of old buildings, fashion trends, environmental sustainability and technological development on interior design. Therefore, this course not only explores the differences of interior design in the history, style and cultural background, but also hopes to understand the zeitgeist behind these design works.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "對於當代室內設計的潮流、設計大師及其傑出作品能夠有充份的認識。",
      "describe_en": "Sufficient comprehension of the contemporary interior design trends, design masters and their outstanding works."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "瞭解當代室內設計思潮在室內設計發展過程中的重要性，同時透過課程的訓練能將所學應用在室內設計上。",
      "describe_en": "Understand the importance of contemporary interior design trends in the process of interior design, and apply what they have learned through courses into interior design."
    }
  ],
